{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["级数", "敛散性", "定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 $x\\to0^+$ 时，\n$$\n\\frac{1}{x^a(1+x)^b}\\sim x^{-a},\n$$\n故在 $0$ 附近收敛要求 $a<1$。\n\n当 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时，\n$$\n\\frac{1}{x^a(1+x)^b}\\sim x^{-(a+b)},\n$$\n故在无穷远处收敛要求 $a+b>1$。因此选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/q02_options.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "在 $x<1$ 时，原函数可取 $(x-1)^2+C_1$；在 $x\\ge1$ 时，原函数可取\n$$\nx\\ln x-x+C_2.\n$$\n原函数在 $x=1$ 处必须连续。取左侧常数为 $0$，左极限为 $0$；右侧在 $x=1$ 的值为 $-1+C_2$，故 $C_2=1$。因此\n$$\nF(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\n(x-1)^2,&x<1,\\\\\nx(\\ln x-1)+1,&x\\ge1,\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["微分方程", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": [], "answer": "A", "explanation": "两解之差\n$$\ny_2-y_1=2\\sqrt{1+x^2}\n$$\n是齐次方程 $y'+p(x)y=0$ 的解，所以\n$$\n\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}+p(x)\\sqrt{1+x^2}=0,\n\\qquad\np(x)=-\\frac{x}{1+x^2}.\n$$\n将\n$$\ny=(1+x^2)^2+\\sqrt{1+x^2}\n$$\n代入原方程，得\n$$\nq(x)=y'+p(x)y=3x(1+x^2).\n$$\n故选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["导数", "间断点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": [], "answer": "D", "explanation": "当 $x\\to0^-$ 时，$f(x)=x\\to0$；当 $x\\to0^+$ 时，$x\\in(1/(n+1),1/n]$ 且 $n\\to\\infty$，所以 $f(x)=1/n\\to0$。又 $f(0)=0$，故 $f$ 在 $0$ 处连续。\n\n左导数为\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0^-}\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}{x}=1.\n$$\n右侧若 $1/(n+1)<x\\le1/n$，则\n$$\n1\\le\\frac{f(x)}{x}=\\frac{1/n}{x}<\\frac{n+1}{n}\\to1.\n$$\n由夹逼定理右导数也为 $1$。因此 $f$ 在 $0$ 处可导，选 D。", "methods": ["夹逼定理"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线代", "topics": ["逆矩阵", "特征值与特征向量", "相似矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": [], "answer": "C", "explanation": "若 $B=P^{-1}AP$，则\n$$\nB^T=P^TA^T(P^T)^{-1},\n$$\n所以 A 正确；又\n$$\nB^{-1}=P^{-1}A^{-1}P,\n$$\n所以 B 正确；并且\n$$\nB+B^{-1}=P^{-1}(A+A^{-1})P,\n$$\n所以 D 正确。\n\n但 $B^T$ 与 $A^T$ 的相似变换矩阵一般不是 $P$，所以不能推出\n$$\nB+B^T\\sim A+A^T.\n$$\n故错误的是 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线代", "topics": ["二次型"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "二次型对应矩阵为\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&2&2\\\\\n2&1&2\\\\\n2&2&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n该矩阵的特征值为 $5,-1,-1$，故经正交变换可化为\n$$\n5y_1^2-y_2^2-y_3^2=2.\n$$\n即\n$$\n\\frac{y_1^2}{2/5}-\\frac{y_2^2}{2}-\\frac{y_3^2}{2}=1,\n$$\n这是双叶双曲面，选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["正态分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": [], "answer": "B", "explanation": "标准化得\n$$\np=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\le \\frac{\\mu+\\sigma^2-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\n=P\\{Z\\le\\sigma\\}=\\Phi(\\sigma),\n$$\n其中 $Z\\sim N(0,1)$。因此 $p$ 与 $\\mu$ 无关，并随 $\\sigma$ 增大而增大，选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["协方差与相关系数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": [], "answer": "A", "explanation": "$(X,Y)$ 是二项试验次数为 $2$、单次概率 $p_1=p_2=1/3$ 的多项分布中的两个计数。故\n$$\nD(X)=D(Y)=2\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{4}{9},\n$$\n$$\n\\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y)=-2\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}=-\\frac{2}{9}.\n$$\n因此相关系数为\n$$\n\\rho_{XY}=\\frac{-2/9}{\\sqrt{(4/9)(4/9)}}=-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["变上限积分", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "当 $t\\to0$ 时，\n$$\n\\ln(1+t\\sin t)\\sim t\\sin t\\sim t^2,\n$$\n所以\n$$\nt\\ln(1+t\\sin t)\\sim t^3,\n\\qquad\n\\int_0^x t\\ln(1+t\\sin t)\\,dt\\sim\\frac{x^4}{4}.\n$$\n又\n$$\n1-\\cos x^2\\sim\\frac{x^4}{2}.\n$$\n故极限为\n$$\n\\frac{x^4/4}{x^4/2}=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["多元函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\mathbf j+(y-1)\\mathbf k$", "explanation": "设\n$$\nP=x+y+z,\\qquad Q=xy,\\qquad R=z.\n$$\n则\n$$\n\\operatorname{rot}\\mathbf A\n=\\left(R_y-Q_z,\\ P_z-R_x,\\ Q_x-P_y\\right)\n=(0,\\ 1,\\ y-1).\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\operatorname{rot}\\mathbf A=\\mathbf j+(y-1)\\mathbf k.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["多元函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$-dx+2dy$", "explanation": "在 $(x,y)=(0,1)$ 处，方程给出\n$$\nz-1=0,\\qquad z=1.\n$$\n令\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=(x+1)z-y^2-x^2f(x-z,y).\n$$\n在 $(0,1,1)$ 处，\n$$\nF_x=1,\\qquad F_y=-2,\\qquad F_z=1.\n$$\n由 $dF=0$，\n$$\nF_xdx+F_ydy+F_zdz=0,\n$$\n故\n$$\ndz=-dx+2dy.\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高数", "topics": ["导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "在 $x=0$ 附近，\n$$\n\\arctan x=x-\\frac{x^3}{3}+O(x^5),\n$$\n$$\n\\frac{x}{1+ax^2}=x-ax^3+O(x^5).\n$$\n因此\n$$\nf(x)=\\left(a-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)x^3+O(x^5).\n$$\n故\n$$\nf'''(0)=6\\left(a-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=1,\n$$\n解得\n$$\na=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线代", "topics": ["行列式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$\\lambda^4+\\lambda^3+2\\lambda^2+3\\lambda+4$", "explanation": "按第一行展开并继续计算，得\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nD&=(\\lambda-1)\n\\begin{vmatrix}\n\\lambda&-1&0\\\\\n0&\\lambda&-1\\\\\n3&2&\\lambda+1\n\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n&=(\\lambda-1)\\left[\\lambda^2(\\lambda+1)+2\\lambda+3\\right]+4\\\\\n&=\\lambda^4+\\lambda^3+2\\lambda^2+3\\lambda+4.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["正态分布", "抽样分布", "统计量", "置信区间"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$(8.2,10.8)$", "explanation": "正态总体均值的双侧置信区间以样本均值 $\\overline X$ 为中心。已知中心为 $9.5$，上限为 $10.8$，故半长为\n$$\n10.8-9.5=1.3.\n$$\n因此下限为\n$$\n9.5-1.3=8.2.\n$$\n所求置信区间为\n$$\n(8.2,10.8).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高数", "topics": ["二重积分", "空间解析几何"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$5\\pi+\\dfrac{32}{3}$", "explanation": "在极坐标下，$x=r\\cos\\theta$，$dxdy=r\\,drd\\theta$。因此\n$$\n\\iint_Dx\\,dxdy\n=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\int_2^{2(1+\\cos\\theta)}\nr^2\\cos\\theta\\,drd\\theta.\n$$\n即\n$$\n\\frac{8}{3}\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos\\theta\\left[(1+\\cos\\theta)^3-1\\right]d\\theta.\n$$\n展开后为\n$$\n\\frac{8}{3}\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\left(3\\cos^2\\theta+3\\cos^3\\theta+\\cos^4\\theta\\right)d\\theta.\n$$\n利用\n$$\n\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\quad\n\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^3\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\frac{4}{3},\\quad\n\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\frac{3\\pi}{8},\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\iint_Dx\\,dxdy=5\\pi+\\frac{32}{3}.\n$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高数", "topics": ["级数", "敛散性", "微分方程", "二阶微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I) 证明见解析。\n\n(II)\n$$\n\\int_0^{+\\infty}y(x)\\,dx=\\frac{3}{k}.\n$$", "explanation": "特征方程为\n$$\nr^2+2r+k=0,\n$$\n其根为\n$$\nr_1=-1+\\sqrt{1-k},\\qquad r_2=-1-\\sqrt{1-k}.\n$$\n由于 $0<k<1$，有 $r_1<0,r_2<0$。因此\n$$\ny(x)=C_1e^{r_1x}+C_2e^{r_2x},\n$$\n两个指数项在 $[0,+\\infty)$ 上均可积，故反常积分收敛。\n\n对微分方程在 $[0,+\\infty)$ 上积分：\n$$\n\\int_0^{+\\infty}y''\\,dx+2\\int_0^{+\\infty}y'\\,dx\n+k\\int_0^{+\\infty}y\\,dx=0.\n$$\n由 $r_1,r_2<0$ 可知 $y(x)\\to0,\\ y'(x)\\to0$。代入 $y(0)=1,\\ y'(0)=1$，得\n$$\n(0-1)+2(0-1)+k\\int_0^{+\\infty}y(x)\\,dx=0.\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\int_0^{+\\infty}y(x)\\,dx=\\frac{3}{k}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高数", "topics": ["曲线积分", "偏导数", "多元函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$$\nI(t)=e^{2-t}+t,\n$$\n且 $I(t)$ 的最小值为 $3$。", "explanation": "因为被积表达式是全微分 $df$，所以曲线积分与路径无关，\n$$\nI(t)=f(1,t)-f(0,0).\n$$\n由\n$$\nf_x=(2x+1)e^{2x-y}\n$$\n对 $x$ 积分，得\n$$\nf(x,y)=xe^{2x-y}+C(y).\n$$\n又 $f(0,y)=y+1$，故 $C(y)=y+1$，于是\n$$\nf(x,y)=xe^{2x-y}+y+1.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nI(t)=f(1,t)-f(0,0)=e^{2-t}+t.\n$$\n令\n$$\nI'(t)=-e^{2-t}+1=0,\n$$\n得 $t=2$。且 $I''(t)=e^{2-t}>0$，故最小值为\n$$\nI(2)=3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高数", "topics": ["二重积分", "曲面积分", "面积与体积", "空间解析几何"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": [], "answer": "$I=\\dfrac{1}{2}$。", "explanation": "由 Gauss 公式，令\n$$\nP=x^2+1,\\qquad Q=-2y,\\qquad R=3z.\n$$\n则\n$$\nP_x+Q_y+R_z=2x-2+3=2x+1.\n$$\n区域 $\\Omega$ 是由坐标平面和截距为 $1,2,1$ 的平面围成的四面体，体积\n$$\nV=\\frac{1\\cdot2\\cdot1}{6}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n四面体质心的 $x$ 坐标为 $1/4$，所以\n$$\n\\iiint_\\Omega x\\,dV=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{12}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nI=\\iiint_\\Omega(2x+1)\\,dV\n=2\\cdot\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{1}{3}\n=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高数", "topics": ["级数", "敛散性", "导数", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": [], "answer": "证明见解析。", "explanation": "由中值定理，\n$$\n|x_{n+1}-x_n|\n=|f(x_n)-f(x_{n-1})|\n=|f'(\\xi_n)||x_n-x_{n-1}|\n<\\frac{1}{2}|x_n-x_{n-1}|.\n$$\n递推得\n$$\n|x_{n+1}-x_n|<\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n-1}|x_2-x_1|.\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}|x_{n+1}-x_n|\n$$\n由几何级数比较判别法收敛，即 (I) 成立。\n\n由 (I) 可知 $\\{x_n\\}$ 为 Cauchy 数列，所以极限存在，记为 $L$。令 $n\\to\\infty$，由 $x_{n+1}=f(x_n)$ 得\n$$\nL=f(L).\n$$\n设 $F(x)=f(x)-x$，则\n$$\nF'(x)=f'(x)-1<-\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n故 $F$ 严格递减。又\n$$\nF(0)=1>0,\n$$\n并且由 $0<f'(x)<1/2$ 得\n$$\nf(2)<f(0)+1=2,\n$$\n所以 $F(2)=f(2)-2<0$。因此方程 $F(x)=0$ 的根位于 $(0,2)$，即\n$$\n0<L<2.\n$$", "methods": ["比较判别法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线代", "topics": ["矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": [], "answer": "当 $a=-2$ 时，$AX=B$ 无解；\n\n当 $a=1$ 时，$AX=B$ 有无穷多解，通解可写为\n$$\nX=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1\\\\\n-1&-1\\\\\n0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0&0\\\\\n-c_1&-c_2\\\\\nc_1&c_2\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\qquad c_1,c_2\\in\\mathbb R;\n$$\n\n当 $a\\ne-2$ 且 $a\\ne1$ 时，$AX=B$ 有唯一解\n$$\nX=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&\\dfrac{3a}{a+2}\\\\\n0&\\dfrac{a-4}{a+2}\\\\\n-1&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "explanation": "计算行列式可得\n$$\n\\det A=(a-1)(a+2).\n$$\n因此当 $a\\ne1,-2$ 时，$A$ 可逆，方程有唯一解，直接计算\n$$\nX=A^{-1}B=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&\\dfrac{3a}{a+2}\\\\\n0&\\dfrac{a-4}{a+2}\\\\\n-1&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n当 $a=-2$ 时，对增广矩阵作初等行变换可知\n$$\nr(A)<r(A,B),\n$$\n故方程无解。\n\n当 $a=1$ 时，\n$$\nr(A)=r(A,B)<3,\n$$\n故方程有无穷多解。分别解两列右端方程，通解可写为\n$$\nX=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1\\\\\n-1&-1\\\\\n0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n+\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0&0\\\\\n-c_1&-c_2\\\\\nc_1&c_2\n\\end{pmatrix},\n\\qquad c_1,c_2\\in\\mathbb R.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线代", "topics": ["矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I)\n$$\nA^{99}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2^{99}-2&1-2^{99}&2-2^{98}\\\\\n2^{100}-2&1-2^{100}&2-2^{99}\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n(II)\n$$\n\\beta_1=(2^{99}-2)\\alpha_1+(2^{100}-2)\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_2=(1-2^{99})\\alpha_1+(1-2^{100})\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_3=(2-2^{98})\\alpha_1+(2-2^{99})\\alpha_2.\n$$", "explanation": "由计算可得\n$$\nA^n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2^n-2&1-2^n&2-2^{n-1}\\\\\n2^{n+1}-2&1-2^{n+1}&2-2^n\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad(n\\ge1).\n$$\n取 $n=99$ 即得\n$$\nA^{99}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2^{99}-2&1-2^{99}&2-2^{98}\\\\\n2^{100}-2&1-2^{100}&2-2^{99}\\\\\n0&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n\n由 $B^2=BA$，反复相乘得\n$$\nB^{100}=BA^{99}.\n$$\n若 $B=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3)$，则 $BA^{99}$ 的各列就是 $A^{99}$ 对应列系数下 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 的线性组合。由于 $A^{99}$ 第三行均为 $0$，得到\n$$\n\\beta_1=(2^{99}-2)\\alpha_1+(2^{100}-2)\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_2=(1-2^{99})\\alpha_1+(1-2^{100})\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_3=(2-2^{98})\\alpha_1+(2-2^{99})\\alpha_2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["条件概率", "概率密度", "分布函数", "联合分布"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I)\n$$\nf_{X,Y}(x,y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n3,&0<x<1,\\ x^2<y<\\sqrt{x},\\\\\n0,&\\text{其他}.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n\n(II) $U$ 与 $X$ 不相互独立。\n\n(III)\n$$\nF_Z(z)=\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&z<0,\\\\\n\\dfrac{3}{2}z^2-z^3,&0\\le z<1,\\\\\n2(z-1)^{3/2}-\\dfrac{3}{2}z^2+3z-1,&1\\le z<2,\\\\\n1,&z\\ge2.\n\\end{cases}\n$$", "explanation": "区域面积为\n$$\n|D|=\\int_0^1(\\sqrt{x}-x^2)\\,dx=\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n故均匀分布密度为\n$$\nf_{X,Y}(x,y)=3,\\qquad 0<x<1,\\ x^2<y<\\sqrt{x}.\n$$\n\n给定 $X=x$ 时，$Y$ 在 $(x^2,\\sqrt{x})$ 上均匀。由于 $x^2<x<\\sqrt{x}$，\n$$\nP(U=1\\mid X=x)=P(Y\\ge x\\mid X=x)\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{x}-x}{\\sqrt{x}-x^2},\n$$\n该值依赖于 $x$，所以 $U$ 与 $X$ 不独立。\n\n当 $0\\le z<1$ 时，$Z\\le z$ 只能来自 $U=0$ 且 $X\\le z$，即\n$$\nF_Z(z)=3\\int_0^z\\int_{x^2}^{x}dy\\,dx\n=3\\int_0^z(x-x^2)\\,dx\n=\\frac{3}{2}z^2-z^3.\n$$\n当 $1\\le z<2$ 时，\n$$\nF_Z(z)=P(U=0)+P(U=1,\\ X\\le z-1).\n$$\n其中\n$$\nP(U=0)=3\\int_0^1(x-x^2)\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2},\n$$\n且\n$$\nP(U=1,\\ X\\le z-1)\n=3\\int_0^{z-1}(\\sqrt{x}-x)\\,dx.\n$$\n化简得\n$$\nF_Z(z)=2(z-1)^{3/2}-\\frac{3}{2}z^2+3z-1.\n$$\n再结合端点情形，得到题中分段表达式。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math1_2016", "exam_type": "math1", "year": 2016, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["概率密度", "抽样分布", "参数估计"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math1_2016_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math1_2016_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": [], "answer": "(I)\n$$\nf_T(t)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{9t^8}{\\theta^9},&0<t<\\theta,\\\\\n0,&\\text{其他}.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n\n(II)\n$$\na=\\frac{10}{9}.\n$$", "explanation": "总体分布函数为\n$$\nF(x)=\\left(\\frac{x}{\\theta}\\right)^3,\\qquad 0<x<\\theta.\n$$\n因此样本最大值 $T$ 的分布函数为\n$$\nF_T(t)=P(T\\le t)=\\left[F(t)\\right]^3\n=\\left(\\frac{t}{\\theta}\\right)^9,\\qquad 0<t<\\theta.\n$$\n求导得\n$$\nf_T(t)=\\frac{9t^8}{\\theta^9},\\qquad 0<t<\\theta.\n$$\n于是\n$$\nE(T)=\\int_0^\\theta t\\frac{9t^8}{\\theta^9}\\,dt\n=\\frac{9}{10}\\theta.\n$$\n要使 $aT$ 为 $\\theta$ 的无偏估计，需要\n$$\naE(T)=\\theta,\n$$\n故\n$$\na=\\frac{10}{9}.\n$$", "methods": []}
